name nolbreaks
category Package
revision 26786
shortdesc No line breaks in text
relocated 1
longdesc Use \nolbreaks{some text} to prevent line breaks in "some
longdesc text". This has the advantage over \mbox{} that glue (rubber
longdesc space) remains flexible. Most common cases are handled here
longdesc (\linebreak is disabled, for example) but spaces hidden in
longdesc macros or { } can still create break-points.
runfiles size=2
 RELOC/tex/latex/nolbreaks/nolbreaks.sty
